mapping "W2428.1" source="W2428" target="269716005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source = Swedish 5-character ICD-10 extension of W24 SNOMED CT 269716005, adding
        place-of-occurrence (school, sports area, street/highway, trade/service area) and activity
        (sport, leisure, work, vital activity, other/unspecified) granularity. Target SNOMED CT 432534 =
        (concept_code 269716005), standard_concept=S. Athena ICD10CM W24 -> 432534 crosswalk verified
        (concept_id_1=1575638); ICD10 W24 (45756277) -> 432534 also present. Target subsumes the source:
        every Swedish W24xx extension is by definition a machinery-contact accident. The place/activity
        dimensions have no standard SNOMED CT analogue — the [X]Contact-with-lifting-and-transmission
        SNOMED CT concepts (40420602 series) are deprecated (invalid_reason=D), so 432534 is the best
        available standard concept. moderate: verified crosswalk from the W24 parent, but these are
        Swedish national extensions whose added place/activity axes are lost in the mapping.
        """
}
